{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“你们要称你们的弟兄为阿米",{"noteId":3},"，要称你们的姊妹为路哈玛",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["对不贞之妇的控诉"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"“你们去跟你们的母亲理论吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她不再是我的妻子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不再是她的丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫她别再出卖色相，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"别再露出乳间的淫态。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，我要剥光她的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她像初生之时一样赤身露体；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使她像沙漠，如旱地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"干渴而死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不怜悯她的儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们都是娼妓所生的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的母亲淫乱放荡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怀他们的人行为可耻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她竟说，‘我要跟随我的情人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们给我食物和水、羊毛和麻布、油和酒。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要用荆棘围堵她的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"筑墙阻断她的去路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她要追随情人，却追不上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寻找情人，却找不到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"于是，她说，‘我倒不如回到丈夫身边，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从前的光景比现在还好。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不知道是我给她五谷、新酒和油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又赐给她大量金银，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她却用这些供奉巴力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，到了收割和酿酒的季节，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要收走我的五谷和新酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夺回我给她遮体的羊毛和麻布。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要当着她情人的面揭露她的淫荡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能从我手中把她救出去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要终止她一切的欢庆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"终止她的节日、朔日","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"、安息日及其他节期。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她说她的葡萄树和无花果树是情人给她的嫖资，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要摧毁它们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它们变为荒林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被野兽吞吃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要惩罚她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她在节日向巴力烧香。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时她戴耳环佩首饰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追逐她的情人，把我忘记。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对不贞之妇的爱"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“然而，我要引导她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"领她到旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"柔声安慰她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把葡萄园再赐给她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使灾祸之谷","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"成为希望之门。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她要在那里欢唱，如在妙龄之时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如从埃及出来之日。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“那时，你要称我为丈夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再称我为主人","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要从你口中除掉巴力的名字，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不让你提起它们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我要跟田间的走兽、空中的飞鸟及地上的爬虫立约。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要从地上折弓断剑，废止战事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你安居乐业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要聘你永远做我的妻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以仁义、正直、慈爱、怜悯聘你为妻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要以信实聘你为妻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样你必认识耶和华。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“那时，我要应允，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要应允天的祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天要应允地的祈求，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地要应允五谷、新酒和油的祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五谷、新酒和油要应允耶斯列的祈求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把你栽种在这片土地上，归我所有。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要怜悯那不蒙怜悯的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对那不是我子民的人说，‘你是我的子民。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也要对我说，‘你是我的上帝。’”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"“阿米”意思是“我的子民”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"“路哈玛”意思是“得蒙怜悯”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"“朔日”即每月初一。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“灾祸之谷”希伯来文是“亚割谷”，“亚割”意思是“灾祸”。参见约书亚记第七章。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":15}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"此处的“主人”希伯来文是“巴力”。“巴力”意思是“主人或丈夫”，也是迦南人神明的名字。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}